  _lines:
    Greeting:
    - You. Vent person. I require {product}. Discreetly.
    - My assistant said you have {product}. My assistant is usually wrong.
    - '{name}, Regional Director of Paperwork. {product}. Now.'
    Accept:
    - Acceptable. Invoice my shell company.
    - Adequate. Don't tell the Federation.
    - Fine. This meeting never happened.
    TooExpensive:
    - '{price}? I''ve audited people for less. {counter}.'
    - Absurd. {counter}, and I'll forget your face.
    QualityRejected:
    - "This is beneath me. Literally \u2014 I'm standing on a better carpet."
    - I said premium. Do you know what premium means?
    WalkAway:
    - I have a three o'clock. Goodbye.
    - Wasting my time is a billable offence.
    Impatient:
    - My time is worth more than your entire vent.
    - I'm leaving. Write that down.
